SUMMARY:Manic EMU v2.0.1
DESCRIPTION:Manic EMU 2.0.1 | ManicEMU.v2.0.1.SideloadJIT\n\n- Added Wonder
 Swan support\n- Added NAOMI\, Atomiswave\, and System SP arcade support\n-
  Added Flash support\n  · Skin button binding\n  · Hardware keyboard inp
 ut\n  · Software keyboard input\n  · Touch input\n- Built-in\, self-cont
 ained JIT — no external debugger required\n- Added Slow Motion\n- Improv
 ed GameCube and Wii performance\n- GameCube now supports multi-disc games\
 n- Improved Wii motion controls\n- Simulate the Wii IR pointer by touch\n-
  Add games from other emulators via a link\n- Fixed some arcade systems th
 at wouldn’t run\n- Fixed Dreamcast games running too fast\n- Fixed PSP c
 rashes\n- Added NDS lid open/close\n- Improved rotation: with orientation 
 lock on in Control Center\, the app no longer snaps back to portrait\n- In
 -game shortcut tips can now be turned off\n- Landscape library can disable
  carousel style\n- Smoother landscape carousel scrolling\n- MultiDisc Help
 er supports more formats\n- Hardware keyboard input for Symbian\, Amiga\, 
 and C64\n- Added RomM support\n  · LAN self-hosted servers only\n  · Syn
 c only for games imported from RomM\n  · Manual sync only\, from the serv
 ice card’s long-press menu\n  · Pull ROMs\, covers\, metadata\, manuals
 \, and game saves\n- Fixed a launch timeout that could quit the app on old
 er devices\n- N64 now supports ROMs larger than 64 MB
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/manicemu.json
